    "updated_at": "2016-02-11T01:37:04Z",
    "body": "@ojanvafai - I don't think we make separate decisions for subframes within a single browser tab (separate from the toplevel frame in the tab), although I could be wrong.  I do think we use multiple factors to make the decisions about toplevel browser tabs, though; not just whether the tab is selected.\n",
